{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"brindar":{"host":"a4d18e28","siblings":["1a2fedab"]}},"rows":{"1a2fedab":{"word":"brindar","rank":9833,"meanings":[{"headword":"brindar","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:brindar:0b2","translation":"to toast","context":"to make a toast"},{"headword":"brindar","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:brindar:4a6","translation":"to drink","context":"to make a toast"},{"headword":"brindar","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:brindar:e84","translation":"to offer","context":"to give freely"}]}},"examples":{"1a2fedab":{"m":[[{"t":"Llegaremos allí, pero primero, vamos a brindar por tu culo.","e":"We're gonna get you there, but first, we are toasting your ass.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"7c162525459dc20a846fad5a965444c6","i":"09e47082c15dc20d33f23de176173917","r":"6142810:7058913:30:3761164","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6142810","7058913","30"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Está bien, puedes brindar con lo que quieras, nene.","e":"It's okay, you can toast with whatever you want, baby.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"53fa9454236031e29ec4c44c002daca0","i":"1f5d1998077dcd1625d21435e177af27","r":"493076:6615035:319:1247199","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["493076","6615035","319"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Voy a necesitar todo el café que pueda brindar este lugar.","e":"You know what, I'm gonna need about as much black coffee as this place would pump out. So, just keep it coming.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"d982a2d4ec01a546d6ecba35c465ba81","i":"391a530df048bc6f9729bec5768877b1","r":"4950322:6558408:307:1277010","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4950322","6558408","307"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Da mala suerte tomar un trago sin brindar.","e":"It's bad luck to take a shot without toasting.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"3742305d22861009cc953fd9152c83c1","i":"588194bb9f19d28a002c578770139f5c","r":"6394852:6926490:24:3998285","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6394852","6926490","24"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Ahora ve a por champán, tenemos que brindar.","e":"Go get the champagne, we'll have a toast.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"f58143af7b031ad4d17c34e8e3afb9f8","i":"7dfc4f978b8acfc4100f5593fe29b370","r":"5764610:6648657:212:2478793","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5764610","6648657","212"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No puedo brindar por el futuro con agua.","e":"No, I can't toast to our future with water.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"b33f58edc4c104f82948d170a239c03d","i":"884348ec9671e7aaafd78ad401f423bd","r":"5517540:6817321:355:2173086","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5517540","6817321","355"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Hay alguien más por quien me gustaría brindar.","e":"There's someone else I'd like to toast.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"bfa3dc11c7fe8f07460eebe1e5ff9bf4","i":"92d62960c34cc72807a8872f8d8cfcd0","r":"5143522:6463347:220:1502335","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5143522","6463347","220"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Queda algo de champán para brindar con un amigo?","e":"Any champagne left for a toast with a friend?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"6106ca69c29aa03312df63b17716aca5","i":"99c916c0f6c0775b7511f970b9fd5189","r":"5870528:6986055:147:3521801","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5870528","6986055","147"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No voy a brindar por esa maldita mujer.","e":"I'm not going to toast that bloody woman.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"0929f79c7e6b9fd3c24fe4b24b0d0001","i":"c1656b00fe53f8a808c4103822493eee","r":"6537984:6973647:269:4083742","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6537984","6973647","269"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Quisiera brindar por mi madre por organizar todo esto.","e":"I'd like to toast my mother for organizing all this.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"74e1552a70e0b66211561f0e01482483","i":"cce005c088dab16319b60929e6be7aa7","r":"6154172:7020773:421:3774192","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6154172","7020773","421"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Hay que brindar porque hallamos un local para mi biblioteca.","e":"So, we have something to toast because we found property for my library.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"f658e76f0d1eb66892ac24f7592861c8","i":"d38f424a5ca5af9ecc57020671bd7615","r":"6030442:6974216:91:3677003","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6030442","6974216","91"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Excepto cuando se trata de brindar su propia gloria.","e":"Except when it comes to toasting his own glory.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"fe4e472ff4184e8795ca63f5bb98c5dc","i":"ee2c8501111b3df25b3c656ee545a2c7","r":"2404233:6631764:65:143026","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2404233","6631764","65"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Estás seguro de que no quieres brindar por la venta?","e":"You sure you don't want to toast the transaction?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"4bf58efba45a986571734a25f0337d83","i":"f13921b8bbc6db60ac0190e441c9753a","r":"5607494:6880865:513:3298164","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5607494","6880865","513"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Quieres brindar por nuestra primera noche aquí con agua?","e":"You want to toast our first night here with water?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"e3cb5307015bd37a3430738d80ee150d","i":"fc4e1ac83517ecf88b584ea14d88733e","r":"5563352:6917875:375:2252546","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5563352","6917875","375"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Da mala suerte brindar con agua.","e":"It's bad luck to toast with water.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"dbd93c1e8ff78a45195ad669fb233079","i":"4d5857406b8abde21fa2afc4ae83b3d6","r":"6221478:6962944:664:3856545","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6221478","6962944","664"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Quiero brindar por mi hermano mayor.","e":"I want to toast my big brother.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"723773bdafb19447e25b5746be39e34b","i":"a50ebb9621c05c6d234d189201410ed0","r":"5820030:6881022:643:2513893","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5820030","6881022","643"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Tenemos algo por lo que brindar.","e":"We have something to toast.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"239f7db2654e17219d4cfaa6d6a5a767","i":"c719cd2202b74a8623587b91e30c597a","r":"5538002:7015142:16:3248203","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5538002","7015142","16"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Me encantaría brindar con vosotros.","e":"I would love to make a toast to you guys.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"1affa0190ae2cd088226d4f120f840ca","i":"53272901ef7bfab35ef6d7203e51ec6e","r":"5668638:6993941:17:3351178","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5668638","6993941","17"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Por qué deberíamos de brindar?","e":"What should we toast to?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"d2786c1f52738c8c698331b27db7a38b","i":"ae6d2183cc5792995c101ac0cf4a8903","r":"4706888:6772862:655:991482","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4706888","6772862","655"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Joder, vamos a brindar.","e":"Hell, let's... let's toast it up, man.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"3d0c0133b2896b821d3ed7963cbdea24","i":"0d1dfa5b5b9a29be1471a4a5729d4539","r":"5721504:6769454:264:2445880","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5721504","6769454","264"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[{"t":"Vamos a brindar por la mujer de los zapatos blancos.","e":"Here's to the lady with the white shoes.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"1fcb1295fbad328fe27817a1aac7ab45","i":"110804aaba656fcf92078a93ce95edb3","r":"4227538:6753417:214:555419","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4227538","6753417","214"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Creo que es algo por lo que todos tenemos que beber y brindar.","e":"I think that's something we can all drink to.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"eee731eff51af9a0864893c6f673327a","i":"242be460cf3376469aafbe1bb2c23412","r":"4426900:6560915:343:682570","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4426900","6560915","343"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¡Quiero brindar con el mejor disfraz del lugar!","e":"I wanna do a shot with the best costume in the house!","s":"opensubtitles","x":"1961d1042557ac25e146de171626e427","i":"470d89a7d409652f6151b3f276730e10","r":"5345298:6767165:381:1952044","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5345298","6767165","381"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Nada me haría más feliz que brindar por tu nueva vida, pero no puedo.","e":"Nothing would make me happier than to raise a glass to your new life, but I can't.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"4ba70b5efb3509471d209d3b887aa464","i":"b99542369b941c6f800a446d556f5b34","r":"5176286:6480374:7:1561715","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5176286","6480374","7"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Sí, voy a brindar por eso.","e":"Yeah, I'll drink to that.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"8205d499151c5210c7ab9b51504eaf1f","i":"026d90b12557db2bdafe10f582fb9afa","r":"2032572:6842618:1530:100190","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2032572","6842618","1530"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Por qué tenemos que brindar?","e":"What should we drink to?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"dee05683d8493ed70a585ebdb4d61a78","i":"087d0e7cb783a29c191d266b1c63472d","r":"6230746:6802193:661:2822844","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6230746","6802193","661"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¿Por qué vamos a brindar?","e":"What are we drinking to?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"899da3049a4eea613e21dd68106e1bff","i":"2a37a6fcd5dfcf632e63c2af7e30d124","r":"4462682:6553796:603:716121","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4462682","6553796","603"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Deberíamos brindar por eso.","e":"We should drink to that.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"738169ac323c88b1eca378242d974767","i":"2937edb2705154335403853389c556e6","r":"5668638:6993941:918:3352014","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5668638","6993941","918"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[]]}}}